# Config.FISHING.nonVanillaFish (see feature/fishing/Fishing.java). Loaded by RetroAPI's own
# LangLoader, which scans assets/<modid>/lang/en_US.lang for every installed mod - nothing extra
# to wire up on RetroTweaks' side. Names match FishinFoodTweaks' own en_US.lang exactly.
