# English strings for the WAYS achievement pages (feature/scoring/achievement/ScoreAchievements.java).
# Loaded only by RetroAPI's LangLoader, which scans every installed mod's
# assets/<modid>/lang/en_US.lang before any achievement is constructed - see
# com.periut.retroapi.lang.LangLoader#loadModLangFiles. Inert on a bare Fabric install: nothing else
# in RetroTweaks reads a lang file, and this one is simply never opened without RetroAPI.
#
# The .desc lines are only what an achievement shows before its first live refresh (and, for
# real_10_days/real_100_days, for its whole life - see WaysDaysAchievements); every other
# description is overwritten with a live count/score the moment the achievements screen opens.

gui.retroapi.achievementPage.retrotweaks.waysbasic=WAYS: Basic
gui.retroapi.achievementPage.retrotweaks.waysdays=WAYS: Days
gui.retroapi.achievementPage.retrotweaks.ways404=WAYS: 404

